(label "GND" (at 64.77 384.81 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "744dbac8-1c13-587f-9c20-531472316c7e"))
(text "Independent USB power only. INA229 U_PM measures the interposer shunt via J_SENSE. No DUT supply on carrier.\nLED1-5 GP27/26/22/21/20. INA229 SPI0 GP4-7. SD SPI1 GP12-15.\nU_SD input: USB VBUS (physical 40). EN: Pico 3V3. SD_3V3 is separate.\nCard CMD and DAT0-3 have 10k pull-ups to SD_3V3; CLK has no pull-up.\nNo card-detect switch. Buffered logger firmware is a separate milestone.\nInterposer cables straight-through. Bench validation pending." (at 220 385 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "3c0a9f1d-7be4-5de2-ae2d-031d05b797d9"))
)
